      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know for sure which threads might call this; I can take a closer look if you\u0027d like.\n\nI\u0027m guessing your underlying concern, though, is that LastMileLogger isn\u0027t thread-safe. And that is totally justified, as LML is not thread-safe.\n\nThe idea is that LastMileLogger will only be used by WifiDiagnostics. And WifiDiagnostics _is_ thread-safe. (Or, so I believe. :-))\n\nWould it be useful for me to add this info to the notes in the commit message?",
