      "writtenOn": "2017-01-20T03:32:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "i can believe that WifiDiagnostics should be thread safe - but just for fun, can you make sure (code search maybe?) that we don\u0027t have some nasty direct call to connect or something.   I think everything should be triggered through WSM\u0027s handler, but..   you never know.\n\nThere isn\u0027t a call to it from supplicant state tracker or a broadcast handler that gets a supplicant state update..  that is what i was mostly worried about.  We aren\u0027t the most consistent with dealing with stuff like that.",
