      "writtenOn": "2017-01-19T07:42:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "if you got two calls back to back (not sure how, but i wouldn\u0027t be willing to say it couldn\u0027t happen) that you have a connection started and you already have one running, would you want to clear the trace you already had going?\n\ni could see where this could clear data you need though...  and you might want the trace to continue if you didn\u0027t get a failed/success since they are overlapping anyway.   just a thought.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 68,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "90dc747bf743783e279bb171131149b60935d504",
