      "writtenOn": "2017-01-20T01:49:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Based on the comment below (line 167), I\u0027ve added a couple of cases to test the way that dump on your comment below.\n\nFor the two situations you mention here, though, I think it\u0027s better not to over-commit about expected behavior:\n- For dump-while-pending, we have a case that shows that we\u0027ll get the pending data in the dump. But the fact that the residual data might show up in the next dump is not something I want to guarantee. Hence, I don\u0027t think we want to test this aspect of behavior.\n- For multiple-consecutive-successes: again, I consider this an implementation artifact, rather than a behavior that we guarantee to maintain.",
